Article 7-2 (Head of Analysis and Experimentation Office)
(1) The head shall be a general officer or civilian military employee of Grade II or higher. <Amended on September 5, 2017>
(2) The head shall assist the Chairman and Vice Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff with:
1. Modeling and simulation for joint experiments, joint operations, combined operations, and joint exercises (hereinafter referred to as "joint experiments, etc.") and improvement thereof;
2. Analysis of force development and combat development requirements;
3. Other affairs concerning joint experiments, etc.
